cityguards guards head~
The Cityguard's head~
The Cityguard's head spins and flies around the room.~
A greenish aura of light surrounds what appears to be
the disembodied and mutilated head of a former Cityguard.
Its eyes are burnt out, and its teeth filed to points.
It hisses in agony and gnashes its teeth.~
